# Normalize line endings: LF everywhere — repo AND working tree.
# Kills the per-command CRLF warning churn documented 2026-07-28. Declared here
# rather than via core.autocrlf so the setting travels to every clone/machine;
# local core.autocrlf=true was the source of the churn and .gitattributes wins.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
# The pre-commit hook is a sh script — must stay LF in the working tree too.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
